---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Privacy Promise | Kin & Campus">
<div class="w ph"><div class="eyebrow">Our privacy promise</div><h1>You'll hear from us. They decide what we share.</h1><p class="lead">Your student is an adult, and the law treats their health information as theirs. We turn that into something that works for families.</p></div>
<div class="w"><div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Student chooses</h3><p>At sign-up, your student picks what we can share with you.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="num">2</div><h3>You stay informed</h3><p>You get the updates they've approved, in plain language.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Change anytime</h3><p>Sharing can be adjusted whenever your student wants.</p></div></div>
<p class="note">If we believe your student is in danger, we'll act to keep them safe, as the law allows. [FINALIZE SHARING LEVELS AND WORDING WITH YOUR ATTORNEY]</p></div>
</Layout>
